==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|за-|грузи́ть}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|загрузи́ть}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-загрузить.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|загрузи́ть|pf|impf=загружа́ть}}

# to [[load]]
# {{lb|ru|engineering}} to [[feed]]
# to [[engage]], to [[occupy]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''загрузи́ть''' [[кто-либо|кого́-либо]]|t=to give someone a full-time job; keep someone fully occupied}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[он]] [[о́чень]] '''загру́жен'''|t=he is overloaded with work}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''загрузи́ть''' [[на]] [[полный|по́лную]] [[мо́щность]]|t=to keep running at full capacity}}
# {{lb|ru|computing}} to [[boot]], to [[load]], to [[download]]
# {{lb|ru|colloquial}} to [[bend someone's ear]], to [[ramble]] [[on]]
# {{lb|ru|medicine|slang}} to render someone heavily sedated with medication, especially psychotropic medication; to [[snow]]

====Conjugation====
